# Kokomi Furina Yelan Mavuika. ~21s Rot. Kokomi uses her skill before Furina and refreshes it with her burst, which is sandwiched by Yelan skills. Mavuika provides vaped SubDPS and Scroll after Yelan uses her burst. Not hyperoptimized.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
kokomi char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
